@.str.203 = private unnamed_addr constant [2518 x i8] c"Compute various metrics between two point clouds.\0A\0ACurrently, Chamfer distance, Hausdorff distance and F-Score `[Knapitsch2017] <../tutorial/reference.html#Knapitsch2017>`_ are supported.\0AThe Chamfer distance is the sum of the mean distance to the nearest neighbor\0Afrom the points of the first point cloud to the second point cloud. The F-Score\0Aat a fixed threshold radius is the harmonic mean of the Precision and Recall.\0ARecall is the percentage of surface points from the first point cloud that have\0Athe second point cloud points within the threshold radius, while Precision is\0Athe percentage of points from the second point cloud that have the first point\0Acloud points within the threshold radius.\0A\0A.. math::\0A    :nowrap:\0A\0A    \\begin{align}\0A        \\text{Chamfer Distance: } d_{CD}(X,Y) &= \\frac{1}{|X|}\\sum_{i \\in X} || x_i - n(x_i, Y) || + \\frac{1}{|Y|}\\sum_{i \\in Y} || y_i - n(y_i, X) ||\\\\\0A        \\text{Hausdorff distance: } d_H(X,Y) &= \\max \\left\\{ \\max_{i \\in X} || x_i - n(x_i, Y) ||, \\max_{i \\in Y} || y_i - n(y_i, X) || \\right\\}\\\\\0A        \\text{Precision: } P(X,Y|d) &= \\frac{100}{|X|} \\sum_{i \\in X} || x_i - n(x_i, Y) || < d \\\\\0A        \\text{Recall: } R(X,Y|d) &= \\frac{100}{|Y|} \\sum_{i \\in Y} || y_i - n(y_i, X) || < d \\\\\0A        \\text{F-Score: } F(X,Y|d) &= \\frac{2 P(X,Y|d) R(X,Y|d)}{P(X,Y|d) + R(X,Y|d)} \\\\\0A    \\end{align}\0A\0AArgs:\0A    pcd2 (t.geometry.PointCloud): Other point cloud to compare with.\0A    metrics (Sequence[t.geometry.Metric]): List of Metric s to compute. Multiple metrics can be computed at once for efficiency.\0A    params (t.geometry.MetricParameters): This holds parameters required by different metrics.\0A\0AReturns:\0A    Tensor containing the requested metrics.\0A\0AExample::\0A\0A    from open3d.t.geometry import TriangleMesh, PointCloud, Metric, MetricParameters\0A    # box is a cube with one vertex at the origin and a side length 1\0A    pos = TriangleMesh.create_box().vertex.positions\0A    pcd1 = PointCloud(pos.clone())\0A    pcd2 = PointCloud(pos * 1.1)\0A\0A    # (1, 3, 3, 1) vertices are shifted by (0, 0.1, 0.1*sqrt(2), 0.1*sqrt(3))\0A    # respectively\0A    metric_params = MetricParameters(\0A        fscore_radius=o3d.utility.FloatVector((0.01, 0.11, 0.15, 0.18)))\0A    metrics = pcd1.compute_metrics(\0A        pcd2, (Metric.ChamferDistance, Metric.HausdorffDistance, Metric.FScore),\0A        metric_params)\0A\0A    print(metrics)\0A    np.testing.assert_allclose(\0A        metrics.cpu().numpy(),\0A        (0.22436734, np.sqrt(3) / 10, 100. / 8, 400. / 8, 700. / 8, 100.),\0A        rtol=1e-6)\0A    \00", align 1
